cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "MPCF: certified finite-budget task-path fortification"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of MPCF (Maximum Path-Cut Fortification), a certified
  solver for placing a
  finite protection budget on the nodes of a directed equipment network so that
  the worst-case adaptive cost-weighted path-cut is minimised. Provides a
  compact MILP (MPCF-Exact), a cut-generation solver with exact PathCut
  separation (MPCF-CG), a one-step marginal ablation (MPCF-Greedy), the
  graph-clustered statistical analysis, the seed-extension robustness analysis,
  and the acceptance gates used for the published results.
type: software
version: "0.8.5"
license: LicenseRef-NotYetSpecified
authors:
  - family-names: Huang
    given-names: Zhijie
repository-code: "https://github.com/huangzhijie21/mpcf-fortification"
keywords:
